B) Ask team members to ignore the individual performance targets
C) Keep the current incentives, since HR policies are outside the project
D) Assign each story to one person so that individual targets can be met
= A
? Organisational change often requires supporting systems, such as incentives, to be aligned with the new ways of working.

@@ BE7 | Predictive
After a merger, two departments with very different cultures must adopt a common process delivered by the project. What should the project manager do?
A) Assess the cultural differences and plan engagement, communication and training accordingly
