= A
? Organisational change succeeds when the project understands the culture of the groups affected and tailors engagement, communication and training to them.

@@ BE7 | Agile
Teams that adopted Scrum must still write detailed monthly status reports for executives, which takes two days a month. What should the agile coach do?
A) Help executives replace the reports with sprint reviews and visible dashboards
