C) Hire an administrator to write the reports so that the teams are not disturbed
D) Accept the reports, since executives must always receive written status reports
= A
? Organisational change includes adapting how leaders get information. Sprint reviews and information radiators give executives transparency without wasteful reporting.

@@ BE7 | Hybrid
After the new claims process is announced, many employees express anger and frustration. According to the change curve, how should the project manager respond?
A) Listen, acknowledge the concerns and provide clear information and support
