C) Speed up the rollout so that the period of frustration is as short as possible
D) Tell the employees that negative reactions will be reported to their managers
= A
? Strong emotions are a normal stage of the change curve. Listening, acknowledging and supporting people helps them move towards acceptance.

@@ BE7 | Predictive
The project will close next month, but the new claims process still needs reinforcement before it is fully embedded. Who should own sustaining the change?
A) The business owner and line managers, after a handover from the project
B) The project manager, who should remain in post until adoption is complete
C) The vendor that built the system, since it knows the process best
D) No one, since the process has been implemented and is already in use
