@@ BE8 | Hybrid
Investors and customers increasingly expect projects to report their carbon footprint. How should the project respond?
A) Include sustainability objectives, measures and reporting in the project plans
B) Report the footprint only if a law requires it, since reporting costs money
C) Leave sustainability to the organisation's marketing department to handle
